{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter","id":1373865,"title":"Legendlore Kickstarter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Legendlore"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-10T02:02:05-07:00","id":1373865,"title":"Legendlore Kickstarter","content":"As <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/legendary-legendlore-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Legendlore is announced to have Kickstarter in 2 days, at March 12th</a>, let's start discussion about the coming game.<br /> <br /> <b>What do you hope for this d20 5E game to be or have? </b>I only hope there is something more to it that 'we are taken to the Realm' and 'we are most inclusive D&amp;D-like iteration system'. ( Even if those things are great and made me interested in the first place in it. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-10T02:05:42-07:00","id":1373866,"title":"","content":"D&amp;D Cartoon Intro that is based on the same idea as<b> Legendlore</b>...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3JjhQ1Oi_3k\" data-code=\"3JjhQ1Oi_3k\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/3JjhQ1Oi_3k/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T04:47:38-07:00","id":1374321,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to this one. My group and I really enjoyed the demo Travis ran at Pax Unplugged. It's still 5th Edition but the changes made it very cool. We played it like Jumanji, most of us ending up in different bodies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T04:56:18-07:00","id":1374324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>karpomatic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374321#post1374321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's still 5th Edition but the changes made it very cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>What were changes from basic 5E, more or less? I take it was demo of beta of game, but some highlights would be good to 'sell' it to other RPG gamers to support it. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>karpomatic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374321#post1374321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We played it like Jumanji, most of us ending up in different bodies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Question to me comes one - Could you later swap bodies between yourself? I remember this kind storyline in <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2283362/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle</i> from 2017</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T05:55:41-07:00","id":1374336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374324#post1374324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What were changes from basic 5E, more or less? I take it was demo of beta of game, but some highlights would be good to 'sell' it to other RPG gamers to support it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't recall any rule changes. I was speaking of the setting. It's high fantasy but the people of the Realm know of the ones who cross over from &quot;Earth&quot; with weird tech like cell phones and watches.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374324#post1374324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question to me comes one - Could you later swap bodies between yourself? I remember this kind storyline in <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2283362/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle</i> from 2017</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, not like that. When you're transported to the Realm, you can approximate yourself as a D&amp;D character or change it however you want. In the demo, I made my PC a Dwarven barbarian. I'm actually 6' tall and not prone to violence so I had it be like my new body was letting something out that I would keep hidden. A little violent man. The Jumanji part came in as I was using some Kevin Hart lines from the movie. I was looking for the 2 feet of height I had before we were transported.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T11:11:28-07:00","id":1374378,"title":"","content":"Where is the kickstarter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T11:17:08-07:00","id":1374380,"title":"","content":"Legendlore Kickstart is here! <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/legendlore-rpg-setting-for-5th-edition-fantasy-roleplaying\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...sy-roleplaying</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T13:27:53-07:00","id":1374407,"title":"","content":"Chapter 1 \u2013 <i>Welcome in East Azoth</i> - Interesting is how some parts of fantastical world of Realm are based on the thing from Earth. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Like <i>Othaaris</i>, main goddess of good and fire, is based on Buddhism and there are rumors she was Wanderer. ( Did not term for people coming from Earth to Realm was Visitors? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T20:26:32-07:00","id":1374482,"title":"","content":"Sum up of the information we have from 1<sup>st</sup> Preview of <b>Legendlore</b>:<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">1. Game use term People, not Races, on playable options. Beside <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle-earth_peoples\" target=\"_blank\">Tolkien People</a> standard we get Pixies as small wood spirits. Attribute modifiers are cultural, not inherited. Dwarf risen by Trolls will have their modifiers, not those of Dwarves. Humans have Modifiers from their kingdom background.<br /> </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">2. In game you embrace <i>You</i> as character. But you can choose <i>You</i> as from alternative timeline \u2013 Other You. It\u2019s basically meaningless change in my optics, as if I can change anything I like about myself, it ends \u2018random Earth character coming to Realm\u2019, in practice. It surely can easier going for new players \u2013 <i>\u2018Just imagine yourself in fantasy\u2019 </i>\u2013 but in the long play this change is making you play anyone you like, only that very crumbly, it looks more like you. <b>Legendlore </b>imply even that if you character die, if you cannot do not want for classical <i>\u2018I bargin with demon\u2019</i> or <i>\u2018look for spell of resurrection\u2019</i> \u2013 you can return as Other You version of character. It has logic in this setting, it\u2019s just\u2026 it feels to me like \u201850th Bards\u2019 from <b>Dorkness Rising</b> web series joke\u2026<br /> </div> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/GrtClLRyY0Y?t=126\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GrtClLRyY0Y?t=126\" data-code=\"GrtClLRyY0Y\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/GrtClLRyY0Y/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">3. In <b>Legendlore </b>you get <b><i>Legend </i></b>as splat \u2013 instead Background of D&amp;D, apparently \u2013 where you choose what destiny awaits for your character. Examples are: Avatar of Peace, Bane of Ardonia, Caln of Stone, Regent of Dragons, Suzerain of Blossoms. Legend has most other implications \u2013 it gives you <b><i>Legend Points</i></b> ( I will short them to LP from now on ) that replace basic D&amp;D 5E Inspirations mechanics. LP can be collected individually or communally for whole team. They can be spend on Advantage on rolls or narratively, to make small positive twists or adding supporting NPC to the scene. Think more or less of them as <i>Fortune</i> from <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> games \u2013 <b>Pugmire</b> and <b>Monarchies of Mau</b>. Your Legend points what things you need to do to get LP. Also, Legend implies what People and kingdom likes you, as you are naturally similar to their philosophies.<br /> </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">4. You Cross to the Realm with your technology and have something like 15-20% it will work on the other side. As Visitors from Earth come for the centuries in this world \u2013 and main goddess maybe one of them \u2013 there are whole items, buildings and communities that sustain something from Earth. Examples is shown of the plane in the woods. Or that you can meet Allies looking for Nazis from 1940s.<br /> </div> And that\u2019s all we got to know from this Preview. Second one seems to imply there will be Classes of the <b>Legendlore</b> in it. Text of first implied that there are Alchemists in it, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-12-2020, 11:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-12T23:08:01-07:00","id":1374509,"title":"","content":"What does the game introduce to represent your transported from Earth origin? I\u2019m not super following what\u2019s distinct here from normal 5E high fantasy, except a character background concept that from what I\u2019m hearing don\u2019t appear to affect the mechanics in any way I can\u2019t run out of the normal 5e book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T02:40:55-07:00","id":1374527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374509#post1374509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What does the game introduce to represent your transported from Earth origin? I\u2019m not super following what\u2019s distinct here from normal 5E high fantasy, except a character background concept that from what I\u2019m hearing don\u2019t appear to affect the mechanics in any way I can\u2019t run out of the normal 5e book.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a>. we do not have many mechanics for now in Previews - we got Legend mechanics and People splats. And small frame about technologies coming from Earth. Rest was setting info. Something concrete we will probably get's in Preview 2 - at least Classes will be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T03:48:40-07:00","id":1374536,"title":"","content":"I admit I am incredibly ignorant about 5E - I gather I need the Players Handbook in order to play.<br /> But I fail to find a place where I can purchase it as a PDF? Do WotC really not sell it as PDF?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23748-soulthecorax","name":"SoulTheCorax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T04:27:10-07:00","id":1374542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulTheCorax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374536#post1374536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I fail to find a place where I can purchase it as a PDF? Do WotC really not sell it as PDF?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's because Wizards are putting Basic Rules PDF for free on their site - it's de facto D&amp;D PHB without graphics. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here it is - <a href=\"https://media.wizards.com/2018/dnd/downloads/DnD_BasicRules_2018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://media.wizards.com/2018/dnd/d...Rules_2018.pdf</a><br /> <br /> There is also e-platform of D&amp;D with corebooks packs, but I'm not sure is this PDF of PHB - <a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/source/players-handbook\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplac...ayers-handbook</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-13-2020, 07:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T06:37:04-07:00","id":1374556,"title":"","content":"So I will be fine with the free version? Thank you for that information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23748-soulthecorax","name":"SoulTheCorax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T10:19:03-07:00","id":1374587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1373865-legendlore-kickstarter?p=1374527#post1374527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>. we do not have many mechanics for now in Previews - we got Legend mechanics and People splats. And small frame about technologies coming from Earth. Rest was setting info. Something concrete we will probably get's in Preview 2 - at least Classes will be there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I\u2019ll check back after that comes out","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T15:07:39-07:00","id":1374640,"title":"","content":"<b>Legendlore</b> Kickstarter shared publicly new Class \u2013 Alchemist. It looks good and, truth be told, I missed him in basic D&amp;D 5E rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> @<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\">glamourweaver</a>, you maybe interested in it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/legendlore-rpg-setting-for-5th-edition-fantasy-roleplaying/posts/2784004\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/2784004</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T10:14:59-07:00","id":1375110,"title":"","content":"Today at Kickstarter <b>Legendlore</b> shared a new preview of the text - character Classes. On March 18th Backgrounds (and yet there are, apart from Legend!) and Feats will be available, and March 20th will be Magic and Spells in <b>Legendlore</b>. Each Class can give modifiers instead of Attributes from Peoples' cultures. And now the details of the news from Classes - we get two new ones,<i> Alchemist</i> and <i>Gunslinger</i>. Alchemists are magicians who want magic like science and shut it in a bottle, to help everyone. Gunslingers are a new type of warriors who fight with limited firearms brought by Visitors to the Realm.<br /> \u200b<br /> The other classic classes received new subclasses - Barbarian got <i>Woad Painted</i>, who draw power from runes and tattoos - and <i>Ocean Raider</i> who are savage warriors on ships. Bard receives looking for <i>Bakhurun</i> \u200b\u200bwho also deal with runes and symbols. Cleric gets the <i>Eye of Othaaris</i> - priests of light, fire and observation. We also have Druid of Fantasia, who receive more animal features on a daily basis, like horns, hooves, etc. giving small bonuses. The warriors get <i>O'koth Ranger</i>, who look like a fantasy version of commandos - and White Unicorn, a female order of warriors who defend others. Monk gets <i>Fist of Othaaris </i>who have burning hands and use several of Cleric\u2019s spells. <i>Way of the Broken Sword</i> for a tradition dealing with pacifism and defending others through defensive powers. Paladin gets the <i>Oath of Fealty</i>, which focuses on defending his country, above all. Ranger gets nothing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Rogue has <i>Hidden Shadow</i>, who are the killers who boast that the best of them will kill a dozen people in the light of day. Sorcerer gets <i>Sourceborn</i>, who are connected directly to the source of full magic in the Land - and thus repel the menthruac (???) effect, and then change Warlock receives Parons as the <i>Demon of the Shadow Lands</i>, which is the 'evil demon' here - but also <i>Last Unicorn</i>, which is a force of good, and lets you act with slow moves. The last is the Wizard who receives <i>Arcane Artificer</i> who binds with an object from Earth and they use their magic through him. Then they can repair objects from Earth or even create impossible objects from outside the Land. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a>, you will be interested in this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T11:12:16-07:00","id":1375116,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I\u2019m still not completely sold on how integrated the world crossing is to the mechanics, but I do like the sound of the new classes and subclasses regardless!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T17:17:00-07:00","id":1375180,"title":"","content":"So most related to the Crossing idea are Alchemist, Gunslinger and Arteficers Wizards. Just to look more into those...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T11:43:20-07:00","id":1376283,"title":"","content":"Bad news. Seems like due to the slow progress of the KS, and because of the coronavirus crisis, <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/legendlore-rpg-setting-for-5th-edition-fantasy-roleplaying/posts/2791484\" target=\"_blank\">the KS is getting cancelled and moved to a later date. </a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T11:46:04-07:00","id":1376284,"title":"","content":"I'm really sad about this. That said I'm okay with ot being pistponed for a better day rather thenit not making its funding goal, which it totally deserves.","signature":"","edited